    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_00",
      "hash64": "237871EE06E9D2F5",
      "text": "欢迎光临。\\n点餐请到柜台哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_01",
      "hash64": "237870EE06E9D142",
      "text": "这位同学！\\n你和青木的对战非常精彩！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_02",
      "hash64": "23786FEE06E9CF8F",
      "text": "我呀，只有给自己中意的客人，\\n才会制作可以转换宝可梦\\r\\n太晶属性的料理！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_03",
      "hash64": "23786EEE06E9CDDC",
      "text": "我需要一种叫做太晶碎块的材料，\\n如果你收集到了，就过来说一声哦！\\c\\n作为首次光顾的特典，\\n我会送给你能将太晶属性变为一般的道具！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_04",
      "hash64": "23786DEE06E9CC29",
      "text": "要用添加了太晶碎块的料理\\n转换太晶属性吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
