      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_05",
      "hash64": "23786CEE06E9CA76",
      "text": "我需要５０个太晶碎块！\\n……好像不太够啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_06",
      "hash64": "23786BEE06E9C8C3",
      "text": "我会制作特别的料理，\\n来帮你转换宝可梦的太晶属性！\\c\\n料理需要５０个太晶碎块作为材料，\\n你去收集一下吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_07",
      "hash64": "23786AEE06E9C710",
      "text": "要给哪只宝可梦吃？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_08",
      "hash64": "237879EE06E9E08D",
      "text": "确定要将[VAR 0x0102(0002)]\\n转换为[VAR 0x0103(0003)]属性吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0102",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0103",
          "args_hex": [
            "0003"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_09",
      "hash64": "237878EE06E9DEDA",
      "text": "改变人生的料理！\\n就由我为你制作，请稍等！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_10",
      "hash64": "2374EBEE06E6B96C",
